{"id":"rota-das-emocoes","title":"Rota das Emoções","who":"Classic route · north-east Brazil's dunes and delta, 20 years old in 2025","when":"June to September (lagoons full until about August)","vehicle":"4x4 or transfers, 7–10 days","kind":"4x4","color":"#0891b2","summary":"About 500 km of coast across three states, from the white dunes and rain-filled lagoons of the Lençóis Maranhenses, through the mangroves and scarlet ibis of the Parnaíba Delta, to the beach village of Jericoacoara. Sand tracks, river ferries, kitesurfing and hammocks.","sources":[{"label":"Viaje na Viagem: Rota das Emoções","url":"https://www.viajenaviagem.com/destino/rota-das-emocoes/"},{"label":"Viagens e Caminhos: roteiro e dicas","url":"https://www.viagensecaminhos.com/rota-das-emocoes/"}],"approximate":"Main stops; much of the coast is driven on sand, not the roads shown.","km":700,"bbox":[-44.375,-3.1215,-40.4478,-2.5295],"stops":[{"name":"São Luís","place":"São Luís, Maranhão","at":[-2.5295,-44.2964],"text":"A colonial island city of tiled façades, where most trips start.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/S%C3%A3o_Lu%C3%ADs_A%C3%A9rea.jpg/500px-S%C3%A3o_Lu%C3%ADs_A%C3%A9rea.jpg","page":"São Luís, Maranhão","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:S%C3%A3o_Lu%C3%ADs_A%C3%A9rea.jpg","credit":"Wikimedia Commons","license":"free licence"}},{"name":"Barreirinhas","place":"Barreirinhas, Maranhão","at":[-2.7541,-42.826],"text":"Gateway to the Lençóis Maranhenses: white dunes and blue rainwater lagoons.","source":{"label":"Viaje na Viagem","url":"https://www.viajenaviagem.com/destino/rota-das-emocoes/"},"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/Len%C3%A7%C3%B3is_Maranhenses_2018.jpg/500px-Len%C3%A7%C3%B3is_Maranhenses_2018.jpg","page":"Lençóis Maranhenses National Park","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Len%C3%A7%C3%B3is_Maranhenses_2018.jpg","credit":"Wikimedia Commons","license":"free licence"}},